<title>UK: Albright names Paul Rocheleau as CEO.</title>
<headline>Albright names Paul Rocheleau as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>British chemicals group Albright &amp; Wilson Plc said on Thursday that Paul Rocheleau would succeed Robin Paul as chief executive in August this year.</p>
<p>Albright said Paul would retire in July 1997 on age grounds. Rocheleau is currently president of Albright &amp; Wilson Americas.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
